  "body": "This is an opportunity worth your attention if you are looking for a freehold, comprehensively renovated, turnkey family home in an excellent coastal location and nothing left to do but move in.\r\n\r\nWhy this home stands apart:\r\n- Turnkey. Beautifully renovated throughout with nothing left to do. All renovation work completed with CCC. \r\n\r\n- Quality Construction. Solid masonry construction by respected Synergy Homes.\r\n\r\n- Generational living. Approx 320sqm of floor area, with the lower level offering four dedicated bedrooms alongside a generous second living room, a cool 'den' room, plus dedicated tea/coffee area. The additional separate entry to this level creates the ideal retreat for teenagers, guests, extended family or potential AirBnb. \r\n\r\n- Master Suite. Enjoy a dedicated level with elevated views, office space, oversized wardrobe and ensuite with double vanity.\r\n\r\n- North Facing. Naturally warm and light-filled - a prized north-facing aspect, expansive double glazing windows for sunshine throughout the day while framing elevated views.\r\n\r\n- Outdoor living. Multiple entertaining spaces and a private putting green provide plenty of room to relax or entertain.\r\n\r\n- Double internal-access garage with an oversized storage area for bikes, sporting equipment and everything family life brings.\r\n\r\n- Sought-after educational options. Families will appreciate zoning for Milford School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and both Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High School. \r\n\r\nThis is a genuine opportunity to secure a home that offers the rare combination of timeless construction, contemporary luxury and a blue-chip Milford address. If this home has been on your watchlist, now is the time to come and see it for yourself.\r\nContact Harry Richards to view 021 0814 4513",
